/* c.SMB2Xport - Direct TCP transport for SMB2/3 (port 445)
 *
 * Implements a framed TCP transport for SMB2/3. Messages are sent and received with a 4-byte length-prefixed header as defined in
 * MS-SMB2 section 2.1 (Direct TCP transport).
 *
 * The framing is identical to NetBIOS session data (type 0x00) but without the session request/response handshake used on port 139.
 *
 */

